          "text": "According to Arthur Andersen LLP, the petitioners argue that non\u2011parties to an arbitration agreement who could enforce the agreement under State law should not be barred from seeking relief under \u00a73 of the Federal Arbitration Act."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Baker",
          "citations": [
