              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 50,
                "start": 1
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Baker, petitioners assert that the mere request for relief under \u00a73 and the denial of that request triggers appellate jurisdiction."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Baker",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "bf6321e0a078bbd3677e18c3fffb09355fa31fa65d2850d97832371f61d80712",
